      en: ["Builder: Sheikh Khazal al-Ka'bi", "Year built: 1916", "Khazal's title: Emir of Mohammerah (Iran)", "Purpose: Residence and political HQ in Kuwait", "Architecture: Persian-Kuwaiti blend", "Decline: After Khazal's fall in 1925", "Significance: Testament to regional power politics", "Historical context: Pre-nation-state era"]
